        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "When the children of Ammon made war against Israel, the elders of Gilead went to get Jephthah out of the land of Tob.",
      "ko": "암몬 자손이 이스라엘을 치려 할 때에 길르앗 장로들이 입다를 데려오려고 돕 땅에 가서",
      "source_text_hash": "4f6f354ba0aa8bb051b09e8984982332b86cd4c5e01ace1f5e847e93a354db4d",
      "translation_text_hash": "6e301ada0dca281e239bb7c2745fcb459cf83e337a521b79adc03882b7ad99f5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "암몬 자손이 이스라엘을 치려 할 때에 길르앗 장로들이 입다를 데려오려고 돕 땅에 가서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "6e301ada0dca281e239bb7c2745fcb459cf83e337a521b79adc03882b7ad99f5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JDG:11:6",
      "sequence": 6836,
      "chapter_label": "JDG 11",
      "verse_label": "6",
      "locator": {
