        "verse": 22
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 22
        }
      ],
      "en": "They possessed all the border of the Amorites, from the Arnon even to the Jabbok, and from the wilderness even to the Jordan.",
      "ko": "아르논에서부터 얍복까지와 광야에서부터 요단까지 아모리 사람의 온 지경을 취하였었느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "adf9dec6230a327dab268edcd5261059aa5f8aa2689dd4626104551016e79bc1",
      "translation_text_hash": "f79ca1c73d7aad15a8d007b31b485143f8571cd981a5c83dc8a3fbca8e634259",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
