      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 28
        }
      ],
      "en": "However, the king of the children of Ammon didn’t listen to the words of Jephthah which he sent him.",
      "ko": "암몬 자손의 왕이 입다의 보내어 말한 것을 듣지 아니하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "7b26b4680a44694bdfaa91f1596c730c6962b9b029a77b7b7dc77e4a74a5fdb3",
      "translation_text_hash": "5c2eb55796191ac50490630b7f40aaeb68a06a7edea5cd8d3cd46edd03d899bb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
