        "verse": 30
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 30
        }
      ],
      "en": "Jephthah vowed a vow to the LORD, and said, “If you will indeed deliver the children of Ammon into my hand,",
      "ko": "그가 여호와께 서원하여 가로되 주께서 과연 암몬 자손을 내 손에 붙이시면",
      "source_text_hash": "f229df2163c062a2d2e013be6fc970679fd2007d1540801367d8f3f5f078554c",
      "translation_text_hash": "99f496524c8c885a961338556bb37c4f2e59a08c692c91c7f3c8e95438398c4a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그가 여호와께 서원하여 가로되 주께서 과연 암몬 자손을 내 손에 붙이시면"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "99f496524c8c885a961338556bb37c4f2e59a08c692c91c7f3c8e95438398c4a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JDG:11:31",
      "sequence": 6861,
